Aspect score:
Calculate Raw net sentiment
RawNet = P-N / P+N
To find which is more (p or n) -1 to 0 to 1
If p = n = 0, it is missing data in this aspect

Bayesian Sheinkage:
K = 10 prior strength
shrunk score = q = P-N / P+N+10
For very few mentions, extreme measurements 

Evidence reliability:
r = mention / mention +10 
the aspect mention, it is more, r is bigger

So P, N, M, raw sentiment, shrunk sentiment, reliability
They are aspect-level measurement

