Actionability Filtering
What to do?
based on gap, give ranking for aspects

Evidence gate: 
at least 2 measured peer hotels
so evidence is too weak, cannot go into aspect ranking 

Strategy:
A. Fix Weakest
lowest aspect score 

B. Largest Peer Gap
biggest peer gap

C. Most Criticized
biggest Nega mentions

D. What we do
Priority Score =0.45 * Gap_{norm} + 0.35 * Criticism_{norm} - 0.20 * (1-Reliability)

Criticism is negative rate : Nega / Mentions

Norm: 0-1

it is for one aspect for ranking

